1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,194
This is Episode 38.

3
00:00:07,194 --> 00:00:12,885
Every morning Maya carries boxes from Sammy's house to Eddie's house.

4
00:00:12,885 --> 00:00:14,827
One by one.

5
00:00:14,827 --> 00:00:16,422
Oh no!

6
00:00:16,422 --> 00:00:21,609
And a parcel from the old house on the ground has nowhere to land.

7
00:00:21,609 --> 00:00:23,816
Here comes the pipe.

8
00:00:23,816 --> 00:00:26,702
One end at Sammy's door.

9
00:00:26,702 --> 00:00:29,069
The other at Eddie's.

10
00:00:29,069 --> 00:00:32,021
Maya turns the valve once.

11
00:00:32,021 --> 00:00:35,398
Boxes glide through by themselves.

12
00:00:35,398 --> 00:00:37,925
Nobody carries a thing.

13
00:00:37,925 --> 00:00:40,997
And here is the old brass tube.

14
00:00:40,997 --> 00:00:45,172
The ground house sends mail the way it always did.

15
00:00:45,172 --> 00:00:46,648
Whoosh!

16
00:00:46,648 --> 00:00:50,119
It lands right in Sammy's arms.

17
00:00:50,119 --> 00:00:54,428
The tube lets old friends keep mailing the old way.

18
00:00:54,428 --> 00:00:57,832
Now you know AppFlow and MQ!

19
00:00:57,832 --> 00:01:02,526
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

